ghter tones use less ink and feel softer on first wear, but you are not limited to them.\r\nTo reduce stiffness, use patterns or designs with negative space instead of solid fills. Less ink makes the fabric feel softer and more breathable.\r\nExpect slightly muted color results compared to digital previews or sublimation prints. Cotton absorbs ink differently, so the fabric’s texture may show through the print, adding a soft, matte finish.\r\nWhen stretched, printed areas may show fine cracks or the white base fabric, especially at seams, cuffs, or tight spots. This is normal for flexible cotton garments.\r\nPrint results may vary slightly by garment thickness. Thicker fabrics absorb ink differently from lighter items.\r\nWe can’t guarantee a 100% black color match between a pre-colored black fabric and fabric that’s been colored black in the direct-to-fabric printing process. On larger surfaces, the black may appear slightly gray.\r\nProduct code: 140CO\r\n\r\nThis product is made on demand. No minimums.',45.00,NULL,1050,'products/qG6P0njSgLqCMPTvMKkClJWxXnxAMs42tXWj7cnx.webp',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,'{\"left\":0.3,\"top\":0.02,\"width\":0.4,\"height\":0.5}','2026-05-14 22:08:47','2026-05-22 13:55:33'),(63,10,'variable','[{\"key\":\"size\",\"label\":\"Size\",\"values\":[\"2Xl\",\"L\",\"M\",\"S\",\"XL\"]},{\"key\":\"color\",\"label\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Army\",\"Black\",\"Burgundy\",\"Coal\",\"Ecru\",\"Grey Marle\",\"Navy\",\"Pink\",\"White\",\"White Marle\"]}]','AS Colour 5161 I Unisex Oversized Hoodie','as-colour-5161-i-unisex-oversized-hoodie','ASCOLOUR5161IUNISEXOVERSIZED','The AS Colour 5161 oversized hoodie is made with heavyweight cotton and brushed fleece for max comfort. Its roomy fit and streetwear cut make it perfect for layering or making a bold impression. Add your branding to this custom oversized hoodie and give your collection a modern edge.\r\n\r\n80% cotton, 20% recycled polyester fleece\r\nFabric weight: 9.4 oz./yd.² (319 g/m²)\r\nRelaxed fit\r\nLined