DUNISEXSW','The All-Over Print Unisex Recycled Sweatshirt is made of a fabric that feels like cotton and is super soft to the touch. Plus, the inside’s brushed fleece gives an extra comfy feel. Use the whole sweatshirt as a canvas for your boldest designs, and start selling worldwide!\r\n\r\n96% recycled polyester, 4% elastane for fulfillment in the US/Mexico\r\n95% recycled polyester, 5% elastane for fulfillment in Latvia\r\nFabric weight (may vary by 5%): 9.08 oz./yd.² (308 g/m²)\r\nSoft cotton-feel fabric face\r\nBrushed fleece fabric inside\r\nUnisex fit\r\nMoon-shaped patch for a custom logo on the inner back of the sweatshirt\r\nOverlock seams\r\nPrinted, cut, and hand-sewn by our expert in-house team\r\nThe recycled content of this product is certified under GRS (Global Recycled Standard)\r\nThe fabric is OEKO-TEX 100 standard certified\r\nDisclaimers:\r\n\r\nWith dark designs, the white base fabric may show through slightly at the seams and folds (sleeve cuffs, hems, or hoods). This is an expected result of the printing process.\r\nIn case of low fabric stock, we might use comparable fabric to fulfill the order. The substitute will be as close to the original as possible.\r\nTo learn more about eco-friendly product certificates, check out this FAQ article!\r\n\r\nProduct code: #141\r\n\r\nThis product is made on demand. No minimums.',35.00,NULL,1400,'products/5aQYygPUJkSLu8jum5KiR9U0vh2fyxZvg314hiJ1.webp',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,'{\"left\":0.57,\"top\":0.2,\"width\":0.1,\"height\":0.1}','2026-05-15 17:14:36','2026-05-22 15:30:22'),(99,16,'variable','[{\"key\":\"size\",\"label\":\"Size\",\"values\":[\"2Xl\",\"2XS\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\",\"6XL\",\"L\",\"M\",\"S\",\"XL\",\"XS\"]},{\"key\":\"color\",\"label\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"White\"]}]','All-Over Print Unisex Cotton Sweatshirt','all-over-print-unisex-cotton-sweatshirt','ALLOVERPRINTUNISEXCOTTONSWEA','Made to feel as good as it looks, this unisex cotton sweatshirt is built for bold, all-over designs that last. The soft cotton blend offers just the right amount of stretch for a comfortable fit that holds its shape over time. With a clean silhouette and premium feel, it’s a reliable staple for casual looks, streetwear drops, or laid-back loungewear lines.\r\n\r\n95% cotton, 5% elastane\r\nFabric weight: 7.8 oz./yd.² (265 g/m²)\r\nSoft, breathable fabric with a smooth finish\r\nRelaxed fit with drop shoulder\r\nSelf-fabric collar and cuffs\r\nTear-away care label\r\nPilling-resistant and colorfast after washing\r\nBlank product sourced from Mexico\r\nDisclaimers:\r\n\r\nAvoid large solid fills of dark or saturated colors. These areas require more ink, which can make the fabric feel stiff on first wear and appear slightly muted after printing. Lighter tones use less ink and feel softer on first wear, but you are not limited to them.\r\nTo reduce stiffness, use patterns or designs with negative space instead of solid fills. Less ink makes the fabric feel softer and more breathable.\r\nExpect slightly muted color results compared to digital previews or sublimation prints. Cotton absorbs ink differently, so the fabric’s texture may show through the print, adding a soft, matte finish.\r\nWhen stretched, printed areas may show fine cracks or the white base fabric, especially at seams, cuffs, or tight spots. This is normal for flexible cotton garments.\r\nPrint results may vary slightly by garment thickness. Thicker fabrics absorb ink differently from lighter items.\r\nWe can’t guarantee a 100% black color match between a pre-colored black fabric and fabric that’s been colored black in the direct-to-fabric printing process. On larger surfaces, the black may appear slightly gray.\r\nProduct code: 141CO\r\n\r\nThis product is made on demand. No minimums.',39.00,NULL,1100,'products/uVwzWYTxQQqzU9toiP0haF0SXB3tco1ctufKMkVx.webp',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,'{\"left\":0.5,\"top\":0,\"width\":0.1,\"height\":0.1}','2026-05-15 17:22:05','2026-05-22 15:32:17'),(100,16,'variable','[{\"key\":\"size\",\"l