h wash after wash, wicks away moisture, is odor-resistant, and resists snags. A sporty cadet collar and color-matching zip make it a polished choice for activewear or casual lifestyle brands looking for a reliable staple.\r\n\r\n100% polyester interlock with PosiCharge® technology\r\nFabric weight: 3.8 oz/yd² (110 g/m²)\r\nMoisture-wicking and odor-resistant material\r\nRegular fit\r\nSet-in sleeves\r\nOpen cuffs and hem for relaxed wear\r\nCadet collar\r\nColor-matching zipper\r\nTear-away care label\r\nBlank product sourced from Madagascar\r\nThis product is made on demand. No minimums.',23.00,NULL,6500,'products/26kqrMKvZqGDY3FGpqtyrqW4y7daU5sPLrg6rc9d.webp',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,'{\"left\":0.33,\"top\":0.15,\"width\":0.35,\"height\":0.7}','2026-06-03 09:06:39','2026-06-03 09:34:34'),(253,16,'variable','[{\"key\":\"size\",\"label\":\"Size\",\"values\":[\"2Xl\",\"L\",\"M\",\"S\",\"XL\"]},{\"key\":\"color\",\"label\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Black\",\"Bubble Pink\",\"Cool Heather Grey\",\"French Navy\",\"Green Bay\",\"White\"]}]','Women’s Organic Crew Neck Stella Alma Sweatshirt | Stanley/Stella SASW036','womens-organic-crew-neck-stella-alma-sweatshirt-stanleystella-sasw036','WOMENSORGANICCREWNECKSTELLAA','This Women’s Organic Crew Neck Sweatshirt features a brushed fleece interior, providing a super soft, cozy feel. Thanks to the flattering length, this sweatshirt is a suitable everyday choice wherever life’s road goes. Whether meeting friends, working, or just lounging at home, this sweater will assure comfort all day long. Design and sell it online or order for yourself.\r\n\r\n80% organic combed ring-spun cotton, 20% recycled polyester for fulfillment in the US\r\n100% organic combed ring-spun cotton for fulfillment in Europe\r\nFabric weight: 8.9 oz./yd.² (301.76 g/m²)\r\nSuper soft fleece inside\r\n30 singles\r\nRegular fit\r\nDropped shoulders\r\nSet-in sleeves\r\n1 × 1 ribbed cuffs at collar, sleeve cuffs, and bottom hem\r\n2 needles top stitches on all seams\r\nT