esigns that stand out season after season.\r\n\r\n50% cotton, 50% polyester\r\nFabric weight: 8.0 oz/yd² (271 g/m²)\r\nPre-shrunk\r\n1×1 athletic rib-knit collar with spandex\r\nAir-jet spun yarn with a soft feel\r\nDouble-needle stitched collar, shoulders, armholes, cuffs, and hem\r\nQuarter-turned to avoid crease down the middle\r\nBlank product sourced from Nicaragua, El Salvador or Honduras\r\nDisclaimers:\r\n\r\nDue to the fabric properties, the White color variant may appear off-white rather than bright white.\r\nSubtle orange hue shifts with lighting in the Orange color variant.\r\nThis product is made on demand. No minimums.',45.00,NULL,100,'products/ItAH21sZfeluCoRDvJoqikXB3VnaPTbgahxDCXAn.png','products/gB9lJT9SUcNrURsKo3m7m5UBf7Iyiod8cgJmT7L0.png',NULL,1,0,1,'{\"left\":0.4,\"top\":0.25,\"width\":0.2,\"height\":0.3}','2026-06-03 12:01:01','2026-06-03 12:06:38');
